   <\/blockquote>\n\n    <!-- Call‑to‑action -->\n    <h3 class=\"content-headline\">\n      Be Quick: 20% Off This Week Only\n    <\/h3>\n    <p class=\"content-body\">\n      The CURVJEANS Relax is going so viral that sizes are selling out fast. Luckily we still have 20% off this week,  \n      but be quick because this is genuinely a limited time deal.\n    <\/p>\n    <p class=\"content-body\">\n      Unsure about sizing? Just take the fit quiz on the website – it’s seriously accurate. And if it’s still not perfect?  \n      Free exchanges, obviously.\n    <\/p>\n  {% endif %}\n<\/section>\n\n<style>\n  .article-content {\n    max-width: 600px;\n    margin: 24px auto;\n    padding: 0 12px;\n  }\n\n  .content-headline {\n    font-size: 18px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.3;\n    margin: 24px 0 16px;\n    color: #111;\n    text-decoration: underline;\n  }\n\n  .content-body {\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    margin: 0 0 16px;\n    color: #333;\n  }\n\n  .testimonial {\n    margin: 0 0 24px;\n    padding-left: 16px;\n    border-left: 3px solid #ccc;\n    font-style: italic;\n    color: #555;\n  }\n\n  .cta-button {\n    display: inline-block;\n    background: #111;\n    color: #fff;\n    text-decoration: none;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    padding: 10px 16px;\n    border-radius: 4px;\n    transition: background 0.2s;\n  }\n  .cta-button:hover {\n    background: #333;\n  }\n\n  \/* Desktop styles *\/\n  @media (min-width: 769px) {\n    .article-content {\n      max-width: 800px;\n      margin: 32px auto;\n      padding: 0 24px;\n    }\n    .content-headline {\n      font-size: 32px;\n      margin: 32px 0 24px;\n      text-decoration: none;\n    }\n    .content-body {\n      font-size: 18px;\n      line-height: 1.8;\n      margin-bottom: 24px;\n    }\n    .testimonial {\n      margin-bottom: 32px;\n      padding-left: 20px;\n      border-color: #ddd;\n    }\n    .cta-button {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      padding: 12px 20px;\n    }\n  }\n<